# Cloudflare Pages Redirects for Hot Updater Docs
# Format: <source> <destination> [<status_code>]
# Status codes: 301 (permanent), 302 (temporary), 308 (permanent, no method change)
# Specific rules come before the splats that would also match them.

# Redirect root docs to introduction
/docs /docs/get-started/introduction 302

# Open the v0 archive at its introduction
/docs/v0 /docs/v0/get-started/introduction 302

# Build, storage, and database plugins are now adapters
/docs/database-plugins/release-catalog-contract /docs/concepts/release-catalog-contract 301
/docs/database-plugins/release-catalog-contract.md /docs/concepts/release-catalog-contract.md 301
/api/markdown/database-plugins/release-catalog-contract.md /api/markdown/concepts/release-catalog-contract.md 301
/docs/build-plugins/* /docs/build-adapters/:splat 301
/docs/storage-plugins/* /docs/storage-adapters/:splat 301
/docs/database-plugins/* /docs/database-adapters/:splat 301
/api/markdown/build-plugins/* /api/markdown/build-adapters/:splat 301
/api/markdown/storage-plugins/* /api/markdown/storage-adapters/:splat 301
/api/markdown/database-plugins/* /api/markdown/database-adapters/:splat 301

# Native Build (alpha) is not ready, so its page is removed
/docs/guides/native-build /docs 301

# Artifact Compression merged into Bundle Diffing
/docs/guides/compression /docs/guides/bundle-diffing 301
/docs/guides/compression.md /docs/guides/bundle-diffing.md 301
/api/markdown/guides/compression.md /api/markdown/guides/bundle-diffing.md 301

# setUser moved to the Insights client plugin
/docs/react-native-api/setUser /docs/react-native-api/insights 301
/docs/react-native-api/setUser.md /docs/react-native-api/insights.md 301
/api/markdown/react-native-api/setUser.md /api/markdown/react-native-api/insights.md 301
